{"channelId":"UCIt8A6ZVJX2JWtzSdRY-KNw","row":["Brinsley Animal Rescue",22,"Brinsley Animal Rescue was founded by Jon Beresford and partner Bethan Hewis, we met in 2001 and share a passion for animals. We started by volunteering for the Charities Animal Accident Rescue Unit and Prevent Unwanted Pets and soon found our house in West Bridgford full of rescued pets and wild animals. We eventually decided to move when almost every room had a rabbit, a wild bird or a hedgehog in it.\nIn 2007 we bought a 4 acre property in Brinsley Nottingham where we have been welcomed by the local community. We expanded to take on farm animals as well as pets and wild animals and we continue to expand as the funds allow.\nBrinsley Animal Rescue is now a Registered Charity run for animals by volunteers. The Charity is run on vegan values, therefore we do not believe in exploiting animals for food, profit or entertainment.\nWe have no paid staff and our premises, land, buildings, utilities and fuel are donated by us to the Charity free of charge.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIt8A6ZVJX2JWtzSdRY-KNw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIt8A6ZVJX2JWtzSdRY-KNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:26.321Z","channelId":"UCIt8A6ZVJX2JWtzSdRY-KNw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"712b159adcb3048c61b49db111b374448801f9ef3ea4e7cef4bf136b7cec975a","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"97face4506f6442e4484a74f33bc6ec3cfec4aef26f8fe5b824ed1c184b63af7"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIt8A6ZVJX2JWtzSdRY-KNw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":22,"raw":"22 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIt8A6ZVJX2JWtzSdRY-KNw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:26.321Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal resc